  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Migrating a single object from 400,000 objects takes approximately 3.5 hours in our environment, despite using a pre-generated datastream index.  Upon examination, it looks like every single object is scanned (from the filesystem?) then checked to see if it should be migrated.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I ran the following command at 10:02 AM:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "java -jar target/migration-utils-4.4.1-SNAPSHOT-driver.jar --source-type=akubra --datastreams-dir=/fedora3-prod/fedora/datastreams --objects-dir=/fedora3-prod/fedora/objects --target-dir=/fedora-migration-test --layout=pairtree --pid-file=/var/tmp/test-migration-pids.txt --index-dir=/var/tmp/datastream-index --debug",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The file ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "/var/tmp/test-migration-pids.txt",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " contains a PID for a single object.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Looking at the debug log, I saw many of these entries, one per object in our repository:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "DEBUG 10:02:16.741 (UserProvidedPidListManager) PID: 1711.dl:2IWVGDIWTE4FU8Q, accept? false\r\n DEBUG 10:02:16.765 (UserProvidedPidListManager) PID: 1711.dl:X6FSD5T4JBUPS9D, accept? false\r\n DEBUG 10:02:16.786 (UserProvidedPidListManager) PID: 1711.dl:56KTJDLD47H2D8R, accept? false\r\n DEBUG 10:02:16.816 (UserProvidedPidListManager) PID: 1711.dl:6OKBI5VJH3DD49B, accept? false\r\n DEBUG 10:02:16.840 (UserProvidedPidListManager) PID: 1711.dl:ALJVKGFZONRTD8R, accept? false\r\n DEBUG 10:02:16.863 (UserProvidedPidListManager) PID: 1711.dl:5U7C22BGOOC6C8B, accept? false",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Migration-utils scanned approximately 25 - 30 object per second.  There are 390,925 objects in our repository.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "At 10:35, it found the object to migrate, and migrated it:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "DEBUG 10:35:38.890 (UserProvidedPidListManager) PID: 1711.dl:4RJO2AJNM55JH82, accept? true\r\nDEBUG 10:35:38.910 (ResumePidListManager) PID: 1711.dl:4RJO2AJNM55JH82, accept? true",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "After migrating it, it migration-utils then continued to scan through the rest of the objects in our repository.  It finished running at 1:28 PM.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Total run time for one object:  3 hours 26 minutes.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Recommendations for partial migrations, reading from a PID list:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1.  Stop the migration when the last PID in the list is migrated.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2.  Generate a reusable object index, similar to the datastream index, that can be quickly scanned on subsequent runs.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
